creatures:
- name: Giant Ape
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 12  
      **Hit Points** 168 (rollable(dice=16d12 + 64,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 40 ft., Climb 40 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Initiative) (15)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=23)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=5)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-3,label=-3,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=18)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=7)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Athletics rollable(dice=1d20+9,label=+9,dicelabel=Athletics Check), Perception rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Perception Check), Survival rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Survival Check)  
      **Senses** Passive Perception 14  
      **Languages** -  
      **Challenge** 7 (2,900 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +3  

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The ape makes two Fist attacks.

      ***Fist.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+9,label=+9,dicelabel=To Hit [Fist]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=3d10+6,dicelabel=Damage [Fist]) Bludgeoning damage.

      ***Boulder Toss (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 6,dicelabel=Recharge [Boulder Toss])).*** The ape hurls a boulder at a point it can see within 90 feet. *Dexterity Saving Throw:* DC 17, each creature in a 5-foot-radius ***Sphere*** centered on that point. *Failure:* rollable(dice=7d6,dicelabel=Damage [Boulder Toss]) Bludgeoning damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the ***Prone*** condition. *Success:* Half damage only.

      ## Bonus Actions

      ***Leap.*** The ape jumps up to 30 feet by spending 10 feet of movement.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Huge Beast, Unaligned*  
    **Challenge** 7
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024giantape
  status: 1

